          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising 10‑year yields increase the cost of carrying inventories and hedging for oil traders and raise financing strains for exporters, prompting market participants to add a larger geopolitical risk premium to Middle East energy exposure." />
